Website: https://chat.openai.com
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=ChatGPT&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul ChatGPT\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\pard\ql\i Description: Advanced conversational AI from OpenAI.\i0\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Easy access_Compared to certain AI-tools (Midjourney or Visme) ChatGPT is easier to access because it works directly in a browser on different devices and it doesn t require a login.
    Fast_Answers from ChatGPT are generated in a split second.
    Multifunctional_ChatGPT is a general-purpose AI-tool with a chatbot that can answer questions and write texts. It can even generate an image and much more.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Incorrect data_ Answers from ChatGPT are based on training data and may not always be fully accurate or up to date.
    Limited usage_ChatGPT has a limit to certain features such as creating an image or uploading documents. They are only available a certain number of times within a limited period.
    Less specialized_ChatGPT is more general-purpose and may be less advanced in specific professional tasks like modifying an image or simplifying a text to certain student s needs.
\par
