{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=Gemini&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Gemini\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\pard\ql\i Description: Google's multimodal AI assistant.\i0\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Less limited_Compared to other general AI assistants Gemini can do a bit more for free. Gemini creates and modifies images similarly to ChatGPT but it doesn t have the same short daily limit. In addition to that Gemini can also generate videos within the free version but this does take some time.
    Sources_Gemini often provides sources when asked to create an image or write a text about a certain topic. This shows that it uses information from the internet to improve what it is generating.
    Convenient_Gemini can be linked to other Google services like Gmail or Google Calendar. This makes it easier to manage emails and access information across your Google account without switching between tabs.
    Efficient_Gemini is a good general AI to use for analyzing larger documents and using them for tasks such as summarizing or helping with solving exercises.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Rigid_Although Gemini does also allow multiple conversations just like ChatGPT it organizes them differently. This makes switching between multiple chats feel less flexible.
    Inconsistent_Compared to other general AI assistants Gemini can occasionally give shorter or less detailed answers. It s also slightly weaker when it comes to following instructions provided. For example it may miss a piece of information you provided or go into detail about something you didn t ask for. Though this rarely happens.
\par
