\pard\b\fs24 2.2.10 Grammarly\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://app.grammarly.com/
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=Grammarly&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Grammarly\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Multilingual_Grammarly supports more than thirty languages.
    Quality_Like the name suggests Grammarly doesn t just help with correcting spelling but also with improving your grammar. Next to this it also provides options to make the structure of your text sound clearer. Although the free version has a lot of limits it is still much better compared to other free online writing tools.
    Extra_This AI-tool can also be added as a browser extension in Google Chrome which allows it access to your other tabs. This allows you to use it directly in other websites such as Gmail or even you online WhatsApp.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Limited_Grammarly offers a limited number of AI prompts in the free versions. If you sign up for the Pro version you also get access to a few other useful AI-tools. For example an AI detector.
\par
\pard\b\fs24 2.2.11 DeepL\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://www.deepl.com/en/write
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=DeepL&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul DeepL\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Extra_DeepL also offers other features such as a voice translator. In addition to that it can be added as a browser extension for Google similar to Grammarly. This way it can help you while writing an email in Outlook or when working on a Google Doc.
    Options_With Deepl you can choose the style and tone of text you want your message to be written in. For example academic or friendly.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Quality_While DeepL offers good quality writing support by helping you identify mistakes, Grammarly is generally considered better since it is primarily designed as a writing tool. DeepL, on the other hand, is first and foremost a translation tool before it functions as a writing assistant.
    Multilingual_DeepL does not support a wide variety of languages. It mainly focuses on the most commonly used ones.
    Limited_DeepL s free version only allows you to translate up to around 2000 characters at a time. When uploading a document there are also limits on size and format.
\par
\pard\b\fs24 2.2.12 QuillBot\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://quillbot.com/grammar-check
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=QuillBot&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul QuillBot\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Extra_Quilbot has a variety of other features such as an AI detector and a summarizer and so much more. Similar to Grammarly this AI-tool can be added as a google extension to help out with spelling over on other tabs or websites.
    Quality_Next to improving and checking your grammar and spelling but it also gives some recommendations as to how to improve the flow of your writing.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Multilingual_QuillBot only offers a small amount of languages when it comes to the writing assistant. When using the translation feature the options for the languages are almost unlimited.
    Limited usage_Most features on QuillBot are available for free but some are locked behind a paywall such as the paraphrasing options. Other features like are limited in the sense that you can only upload a certain number of characters or generate a fixed amount of images.
\par
\pard\b\fs24 2.2.13 LanguageTool\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://languagetool.org/
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=LanguageTool&from=subcat&subcategory=Writing%20support&category=Communication"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul LanguageTool\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Extra_Similar to other AI-tools such as QuillBot this AI-tool can be added as an extension to your Google browser. It also allows you to upload Word documents unlike Grammarly for example.
    Multilingual_LanguageTool supports a wide range of languages.
    Quality_This AI-tool gives a clear overview of your mistakes and then shows some recommended changes next to your mistakes. LanguageTool  even has a feature where you can rephrase any sentence you select. This feature also gives you multiple synonyms for words to help you change your sentence structure.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Limited usage_LanguageTool has a limit of 2000 characters per text and you can only rephrase around three sentences before reaching your daily limit.
\par
