{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=Diffit&from=subcat&subcategory=Adapting%20texts&category=Differentiation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Diffit\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\pard\ql\i Description: AI-powered text adaptation and rewriting tool.\i0\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Extra_With Diffit you can upload your own documents. The AI-tool also includes a wide variety of books from which chapters can be selected to differentiate texts. Apart from adapting texts Diffit can also generate questions based on a text.
    Options_Diffit allows you to choose between different grade levels when adapting a text. Alongside this the AI-tool also asks several questions before generating the content to create materials that match your preferences.
    Fast_This AI-tool adapts text in under a minute.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Limited usage_When you sign up you get a 28-day free trial with unlimited access to everything. When the trial period has passed your account will automatically revert to the basic version of Diffit and you will need to pay to use certain features. You will still have access to features such as adapting texts and generating questions."
\par
\pard\b\fs24 3.1.4 Kira\b0\fs24\line
