{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=Kira&from=subcat&subcategory=Adapting%20texts&category=Differentiation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul Kira\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\pard\ql\i Description: ...\i0\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Quality_The rewritten text is of good quality. It is very similar to the version in LessonUp but with this AI-tool you can upload a file with your text in it.
    Extra_Kira has a large library of AI tools that can help teachers. For example one of the features similar to a feature of SchoolAI is  vocabulary list  with which you can create word lists with definitions. Another feature is  text translator  which translates text into another language and much more.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Complex_When entering the homepage of this AI-tool everything might seem a bit confusing at first. There are a lot of features in Kira that might make it hard to find the specific AI feature you want to use.
\par
