Website: https://www.lessonup.com/en/app/ai-tools
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=LessonUp&from=subcat&subcategory=Adapting%20texts&category=Differentiation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul LessonUp\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\pard\ql\i Description: ...\i0\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Fast_LessonUp will rewrite a text in less than a minute.
    Multilingual_LessonUp supports a wide range of different languages.
    Options_This AI-tool allows you to choose between different grade levels to adapt the text.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Limited_With LessonUp you cannot upload documents. Instead you need to copy and paste your text into the provided box. This leads to a maximum limit of 10000 characters per input.
    Quality_Overall it is quite good. This AI-tool is closely related to Kira. The only difference being that here you cannot upload a document.
\par
\pard\b\fs24 3.1.6 SchoolAI\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://app.schoolai.com/discover
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thomasmorer0982323-cmyk.github.io/AI-Tools/AIEngine.html?engine=SchoolAI&from=subcat&subcategory=Adapting%20texts&category=Differentiation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf1\ul SchoolAI\ulnone\cf0}}}\par
\b Pros:\b0\par
    Generous_SchoolAI offers many AI features within its free plan. The features behind the paywall are mainly advanced administrative tools.
    Editing_After rewriting a text you can regenerate it if it isn t up to standard yet or edit it manually yourself. SchoolAI includes a built-in text editor with a layout similar to Word. Afterwards you can download the text as a PDF or Word document.
    Extra_Just like Kira this AI tool has a wide variety of features to help teachers save time. For example one of the features is a  rubric  which generates a rubric for your assignment.  Vocabulary list  is another feature which allows you to create word lists with definitions.
\b Cons:\b0\par
    Slow_SchoolAI takes slightly longer than other AI-tools like Diffit or LessonUp.
\par
\pard\b\fs24 3.1.7 Varsity Tutors\b0\fs24\line
Website: https://ai.varsitytutors.com/tools/text-leveler
